$MDESC::Type = "Star Wars";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Location:<f0> The Galactic Empire and the Rebel Alliance have taken structure on the planet Dantooine in the Raioballo sector of the Outer Rim Territories' northern New Territories region." @
         "\n\n<f1>Jedi Archives: " @
         "\n\n<f0>Dantooine" @
         "\n\n<f0>Dantooine? That's in the middle of nowhere. That's the whole point. Where else could the rebels hide?" @
         "\n\n<f0>Grassy plains and low, rolling hillocks and mounds dotted with blba trees. Piket are large long-necked, slow-moving herbivores that feed on the blba trees." @
         "\n\n<f0>Homeworld of Davish Krail, a Rebel Alliance pilot who served in Gold Squadron and was killed at the Battle of Yavin." @
         "\n\n<f0>Spared from destruction by the Death Star's superlaser for being too remote to make an effective demonstration.." @
         "\n\n<f2>Our scout ships have reached Dantooine. They have found the remains of a Rebel base, but they estimate that it has been deserted for some time. They are now conducting an extensive search of the surrounding systems.";

